Description: volume control for PipeWire
 pwvucontrol is a volume control for PipeWire, the PipeWire volume control
 daemon and GUI. It uses the GTK4 graphical toolkit and is written in Rust.
 .
 The interface shows the volume of every sink, source and stream of the
 current session, allows changing the volume and the mute state, selecting
 the default devices and configuring the per-application stream volumes.
